       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PB164VLG.
      *> kb/Work PB164 - THE VARIABLE-LENGTH-GROUP DISPLAY FORMAT.
      *> 14.9.11.4 GR7: "If identifier-1 references a variable-length
      *> group, the format in which its contents are displayed is
      *> defined by the implementor" - AND A.1 ITEM 57 MAKES THE
      *> DETERMINATION REQUIRED DOCUMENTATION (docs/CONFORMANCE.md
      *> row 57). OURS: THE MEMBERS' IMAGES IN DECLARATION ORDER, EACH
      *> DYNAMIC MEMBER AT ITS CURRENT EXTENT - A DYNAMIC-CAPACITY
      *> TABLE EVERY OCCURRENCE AT CURRENT CAPACITY, A DYNAMIC LENGTH
      *> ITEM ITS CURRENT CONTENT - THE 15.50.4 r7 GEOMETRY IN
      *> CHARACTER POSITIONS. FUNCTION LENGTH(G) AND THE DISPLAYED
      *> WIDTH ARE BOTH SHOWN AT TWO EXTENTS SO THE RELATIONSHIP IS
      *> OBSERVED, NOT ASSUMED - INCLUDING ITS ONE SANCTIONED
      *> DIVERGENCE: THE NATIONAL MEMBER GN DISPLAYS ITS TWO
      *> CHARACTERS WHILE LENGTH COUNTS ITS FOUR BYTES (D-N1/D-N3),
      *> SO L = DISPLAYED WIDTH + 2 HERE, EXACTLY AS ROW 57 STATES.
      *> (AN UNTOUCHED GROWN OCCURRENCE SHOWS THE SEEDED WELL-FORMED
      *> DEFAULT - ZONED ZEROS / SPACES - OUR DOCUMENTED CRASH-SAFE
      *> SEED FOR THE INITIALIZED-ABSENT LATITUDE.)
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 G.
          05 GP PIC X(3) VALUE "PFX".
          05 GT OCCURS DYNAMIC CAPACITY IN CAP FROM 1.
             10 GT-N PIC 9(2).
             10 GT-A PIC X.
          05 GD PIC X DYNAMIC LENGTH.
          05 GN PIC N(2) VALUE N"nn".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE 42 TO GT-N(1)
           MOVE "a" TO GT-A(1)
           DISPLAY "L1=" FUNCTION LENGTH(G)
           DISPLAY "G1=[" G "]"
           MOVE 7 TO GT-N(3)
           MOVE "c" TO GT-A(3)
           MOVE "xyz" TO GD
           DISPLAY "L2=" FUNCTION LENGTH(G)
           DISPLAY "G2=[" G "]"
           STOP RUN.
